<title>DENMARK: Tele Danmark sees better 97 net profit.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark sees better 97 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish Telecoms group Tele Danmark said on Tuesday that it expected 1997 net profit to be higher than 1996's 3.104 billion crowns.  </p>
<p>In its 1996 annual report the majority state-owned group said that it saw 1997 results before financial items as above the 4.547 bilion crowns it logged for 1996 while financial items themselves were expected to fall from 520 million.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
